<p>A protective shield forms around you that lasts for up to 10 turns and negates <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">229, 308, 370, 422, 468</acronym> damage.</p><p> 		The total damage the barrier can absorb will increase with your Spellpower and can crit.</p>